WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.840
In 1324, Mansa Musa, the ruler of Mali,
made a famous pilgrimage to Mecca.

2
00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:10.840
In Baghdad, scholars at the
House of Wisdom translated Greek,

3
00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:13.960
Persian and Indian books into Arabic.

4
00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:18.680
Yet in 1514, two Muslim
empires met in battle.

5
00:00:18.730 --> 00:00:22.180
So how did Islam spread
across three continents,

6
00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:26.300
and why did the question of
who should lead divide empires?

7
00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:30.980
In this mission, you'll learn the beliefs
and Five Pillars that Muslims share,

8
00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:33.220
and trace how Islam spread.

9
00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:36.700
Then you'll find out what the
leadership question was really about,

10
00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:39.650
and how Sunni and Shi'a came to differ.

11
00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:43.550
Your mission: find out
how Islam spread so far,

12
00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:47.070
and why the question of who
should lead divided empires.
